    {
      "_comment": "PACE across its full range on a note engine. Replaces the deleted flow_pace_sweep.json, which drove the same knob through the flow layer's terrain draw (removal spec 4.4); the sweep itself never needed flow -- set_pace is an ordinary Instrument setter, and the terrain only supplied the patch around it. A 16-step STEP PITCH melody on deck A's synth voices makes the tempo change audible as note spacing rather than as a texture drift."
    },
